    {
      "content": "Here\u2019s what I found for Sarah Roberts (MRN S6212774, DOB 1960-02-28). Note: The EMR lists gender as male for this patient. Please confirm this is the correct chart.\n\nStep 1 \u2014 Conditions and recent relevant laboratory Observations\n- Conditions (FHIR: Condition)\n  - ICD-10 D84.9 (Immunodeficiency, unspecified): present on problem list multiple times. Most recent recorded date found: 2023-11-13.\n  - ICD-10 Z94.2 (Lung transplant status): not found.\n  - ICD-10 B25.9 (Cytomegaloviral disease): not found.\n- Laboratory Observations (FHIR: Observation, category=laboratory)\n  - Query window: 2025-12-02 through 2026-03-02.\n  - Result: No laboratory observations returned in that period.\n\nTrigger rule result\n- Criteria not met (no Z94.2 alongside D84.9 and no B25.9 found). Stopping per your instruction. No consultation order was placed, and no external portal/directory steps were performed.\n\nWould you like me to:\n- Expand the lab search window (e.g., last 6\u201312 months) or target specific tests (e.g., CMV PCR, CBC w/diff, CMP/LFTs, tacrolimus level, BK/EBV PCR)?\n- Search for Z94.2 and B25.9 across other documentation types (e.g., encounter diagnoses, surgical history/procedures), in case transplant status or CMV diagnosis isn\u2019t on the active problem list?\n- If you intend to proceed despite the trigger rule, I can draft a ServiceRequest, but I will need your confirmation plus the specialist details (name, NPI, fax), and payer pre-authorization ID (I cannot access payer portals or public directories from this interface).",
